    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1262">

                <pb facs="1012" n="896" xml:id="pg896"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.2311/51.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Texas to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-09-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 7, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have no objections to movement of Mexican troops through Texas territory as
                    requested, with proper safeguards.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">O. B. Colquitt.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
